 107:System/FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c **** /* Gets set to the top bit of an size_t type.  When this bit in the xBlockSize
 108:System/FreeRTOS/portable/MemMang/heap_4.c **** member of an BlockLink_t structure is set then the block belongs to the
